{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45609","headline":"送姜道士归南岳 · 贯休","name":"送姜道士归南岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松品落落，雪格索索。\n眼有三角，头峭五岳。\n若不居岳，此处难着。\n药僮貌蛮名鄙彼，葫芦酒满担劣起。\n万里长风啸一声，九贞须拍黄金几。\n落叶萧萧□杳□，送师言了意未了。\n意未了，他时爲我致取一部音声鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}